LOCUS       sequence-467280-        8877 bp    DNA     circular SYN 04-SEP-2026
DEFINITION  Parental vector for the CRISPRi/a libraries. Expresses an sgRNA from
            the U6 promoter and a puromycin resistance cassette and BFP from the
            EF1Alpha promoter.
